   "jp": "「先程、こちらへ送り付けられて来た映像を@　お見せします」",
   "en": "I'll show you the footage that was sent@to us a short while ago.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 259,
   "jp": "光龍",
   "en": "Koryu",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 260,
   "jp": "「……やあ、地球連邦軍の諸君。ハッピーかな？@　僕の名は孫光龍、バラルの元締めだ」",
   "en": "...Greetings, Earth Federation Army. Happy?@My name's Son Koryu. I run the Baral.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 261,
   "jp": "「さて、君達も知っての通り、@　僕らの拠点である“バラルの園”が@　満を持して浮上した」",
   "en": "Now, as you all know,@our base, the Garden of Baral, has@finally risen.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 262,
   "jp": "「準備に色々と手間取ってしまったけど、@　そろそろ計画を実行に移したいと思ってね」",
   "en": "Preparations took more effort than expected,@but I figure it's about time to put our plan@into action.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 263,
   "jp": "「と言っても、心配することはない。@　僕らバラルは地球の守護者だからね。@　君達に救いの手を差し伸べようと思ってる」",
   "en": "Not that you need to worry.@We Baral are Earth's guardians, after all.@We intend to lend you a helping hand.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 264,
   "jp": "「無論、見返りなんていらない。@　君達は黙って、バラルの神の目覚めを@　待っているだけでいいんだ」",
   "en": "And of course, we want nothing in return.@All you have to do is sit quietly and wait@for the god of Baral to awaken.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 265,
   "jp": "「そう、もう少しの間、辛抱してもらえれば……@　君達の格が上がり、俗界桃源郷で@　面白可笑しく暮らせるようになる」",
   "en": "Yes, just bear with us a little longer...@you'll be elevated, and you'll live happily@ever after in an earthly paradise.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 266,
   "jp": "「それは、人間が求めてやまないユートピアさ。@　もはや外敵に怯えることはない。@　未来永劫、平穏に暮らせるんだ」",
   "en": "It's the utopia humanity has always longed for.@No more fear of outside enemies.@Peace for all eternity.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 267,
   "jp": "「そうそう、バラルの神が目覚めれば、@　僕らがルイーナやゲストを討伐するからね。@　君達は何もしなくていい」",
   "en": "Oh, right. Once the god of Baral awakens,@we'll take care of the Ruina and the Guest.@You won't have to lift a finger.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 268,
   "jp": "「心穏やかに、姿勢を正して君達の存在が@　昇華する時を待っていてくれたまえ」",
   "en": "So stay calm, sit up straight, and wait for@the moment your existence is sublimated.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 269,
   "jp": "「あ、それから……バラルの園を攻撃しても無駄だよ。@　どうしても信じられないと言うなら、@　色々とやってみてもらってもいいけど」",
   "en": "Oh, and one more thing... attacking the Garden@of Baral is pointless. Though if you just@can't believe me, feel free to try.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 270,
   "jp": "「ともかく、直にその時は来る。@　僕らの神の下、みんなでハッピーになろうよ」",
   "en": "Anyway, the time will come soon.@Let's all be happy together under our god!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 271,
   "jp": "「以上、バラルの園から孫光龍がお送りしました！@　あははははは！」",
   "en": "This has been Son Koryu, live from the Garden@of Baral! Ahahahaha!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 272,
   "jp": "「フン……随分と手の込んだプロモーションだ。@　来年のカンヌに招待されるぞ」",
   "en": "Hmph... quite an elaborate promotion.@He'll get an invitation to Cannes next year.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 273,
   "jp": "「話の一部は、情報部から回ってきた@　バラルの報告書と一致しています」",
   "en": "Parts of what he said match the Baral report@we received from Intelligence.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 274,
   "jp": "「ああ、鋼龍戦隊は彼らの構成員と@　交戦していたのだったな」",
   "en": "Ah, yes. The Steel Dragons have fought@some of their members.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 275,
   "jp": "「あれだけの岩塊を成層圏にまで押しやる連中です。@　先程の映像は、単なる示威ではないでしょう」",
   "en": "These are people who pushed that rock mass@all the way to the stratosphere. That footage@was no mere show of force.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 276,
   "jp": "「どこかの暇人の狂言である可能性も捨て切れんが……@　あの空中庭園は、現実として受け止めねばなるまいか」",
   "en": "It could still be the hoax of some idle crank...@but that floating garden is real, and we'll@have to treat it as such.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 277,
   "jp": "「ええ。@　念のため、全軍へ改めて非常警戒態勢命令を@　発する必要があるかと」",
   "en": "Yes.@As a precaution, I believe we should reissue@an emergency alert order to all forces.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 278,
   "jp": "「許可する。ただし、詳細が判明するまでの間、@　警戒対象はゲストとルイーナにしておきたまえ」",
   "en": "Granted. But until we know more, keep the@alert focused on the Guest and the Ruina.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 279,
   "jp": "「了解です」",
   "en": "Roger.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 280,
   "jp": "「政府筋や民間には？」",
   "en": "And the government and civilian sectors?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 281,
   "jp": "「今の所、映像を受け取ったのは我々だけのようです。@　もっとも、ガイアセイバーズ側にも送付している@　可能性は否めませんが」",
   "en": "So far, we appear to be the only ones who@received the footage. Though we can't rule out@that it was sent to the Gaia Savers as well.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 282,
   "jp": "「ふむ……」",
   "en": "Hmm...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 283,
   "jp": "「バラルの園への対処は、いかが致しますか？」",
   "en": "How shall we deal with the Garden of Baral?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 284,
   "jp": "「……連合宇宙艦隊は@　Ｈ‐ＭＡＰＷを持っていたな？」",
   "en": "...The Allied Space Fleet has H-MAPWs,@doesn't it?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 285,
   "jp": "「はっ。既にシミュレーションは、@　目標破壊後の状況を含め、数パターン構築済みです」",
   "en": "Yes, sir. We've already run several@simulation patterns, including the aftermath@of the target's destruction.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 286,
   "jp": "「では、直ちに攻撃準備。@　私はヘンドリックス大統領にケースＥでの@　使用許可を求める」",
   "en": "Then prepare to attack at once.@I'll request President Hendricks' authorization@for use under Case E.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 287,
   "jp": "（……孫光龍があの映像を送ってきた理由……@　時間稼ぎか、あるいは……）",
   "en": "(...Why did Son Koryu send that footage...?@To buy time? Or perhaps...)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 288,
   "jp": "（単に自分が楽しんでいるだけなのかも知れんな）",
   "en": "(Or maybe he's simply enjoying himself.)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 289,
   "jp": "連邦軍艦長",
   "en": "Federation Captain",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 290,
   "jp": "「ハンフリー司令、@　Ｈ‐ＭＡＰＷ１番から６番までの@　装填が完了しました」",
   "en": "Commander Humphrey,@H-MAPWs 1 through 6@are loaded.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 291,
   "jp": "ハンフリー",
   "en": "Humphrey",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 292,
   "jp": "「うむ。目標は？」",
   "en": "Good. The target?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 293,
   "jp": "オペレーター",
   "en": "Operator",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 294,
   "jp": "「依然、上昇を続けています。@　現在対地高度２９０キロメートル」",
   "en": "Still rising.@Current altitude: 290 kilometers.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 295,
   "jp": "「……奴らはもうこちらに気づいているはずだ。@　にも関わらず、何も仕掛けて来ないとは……」",
   "en": "...They must have noticed us by now.@And yet they haven't made a single move...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 296,
   "jp": "「司令、統合参謀本部からの命令書を受信しました」",
   "en": "Commander, we've received orders from the@Joint Chiefs of Staff.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 297,
   "jp": "「こちらへ回せ。@　艦長、暗証認識を行うぞ」",
   "en": "Send them here.@Captain, let's run the code authentication.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 298,
   "jp": "「はっ」",
   "en": "Sir!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 299,
   "jp": "「……確認したな？」",
   "en": "...Confirmed?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 300,
   "jp": "「ええ、一致しました」",
   "en": "Yes, it's a match.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  },
  {
   "id": 301,
   "jp": "「よし、Ｈ‐ＭＡＰＷの使用許可が下りた。@　直ちに攻撃を開始せよ！」",
   "en": "Right, H-MAPW use has been authorized.@Commence the attack immediately!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false
  }
 ]
}